 const colors=['#f6b5c9','#e5cef6','#ffd2ad','#cce9d0','#f8e7a5','#bfe2ef','#f6c5a4','#d6d1f4','#f3bbd3','#cfebdf'];function render(){let w=$('#wheel'),list=$('#choicesList'),n=choices.length;let gradient=n?`conic-gradient(${choices.map((_,i)=>`${colors[i%colors.length]} ${i*360/n}deg ${(i+1)*360/n}deg`).join(',')})`:'#f1e8eb';w.style.background=gradient;let radius=Math.max(46,w.clientWidth*.31);w.innerHTML=choices.map((c,i)=>{let a=i*360/n+180/n;return `<span class="wheel-label" style="transform:rotate(${a}deg) translateY(-${radius}px) rotate(${-a}deg)">${c}</span>`}).join('');list.innerHTML=choices.map((c,i)=>`<div>✓ ${c}<button aria-label="Remove ${c}" data-remove="${i}">×</button></div>`).join('')||'<small>Add at least two choices to begin.</small>';$$('[data-remove]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{choices.splice(+b.dataset.remove,1);store.set('wheel',choices);render()})}render();$('#addChoice').onclick=()=>{let x=$('#wheelInput').value.trim();if(x){choices.push(x);store.set('wheel',choices);$('#wheelInput').value='';render()}};$('#wheelInput').addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(e.key==='Enter')$('#addChoice').click()});$('#clearChoices').onclick=()=>{choices=[];store.set('wheel',choices);render()};$('#spinWheel').onclick=()=>{if(spinning||choices.length<2){$('#wheelResult').textContent='Add at least two little choices first. 🤍';return}spinning=true;let n=choices.length,win=Math.floor(Math.random()*n);/* The top pointer is at 270°, so the wheel's final angle must place the chosen slice centre there. */let center=win*360/n+180/n;let desired=270-center+(Math.random()*Math.min(8,120/n)-Math.min(4,60/n)),current=((angle%360)+360)%360;let delta=((desired-current+360)%360)+360*6;angle+=delta;let wheel=$('#wheel'),spin=$('#spinWheel');spin.disabled=true;spin.textContent='Spinning…';wheel.style.transform=`rotate(${angle}deg)`;setTimeout(()=>{let normalized=((angle%360)+360)%360;let underPointer=((270-normalized)%360+360)%360;let actual=Math.floor(underPointer/(360/n))%n;$('#wheelResult').innerHTML=`<h3>🌸 Your Little Pick</h3><p><b>“${choices[actual]}”</b></p><small>Maybe this can be your little thing for today. 🤍</small><br><button class="secondary" id="spinAgain">🎡 Spin again</button>`;$('#spinAgain').onclick=()=>$('#spinWheel').click();spin.disabled=false;spin.textContent='🎡 SPIN';spinning=false},5100)}
